2.
Definitions .-(1) In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Act" means the Actuaries Act, 2006 (
35 of 2006
);
(b)
"Board" means the Quality Review Board constituted under sub-section (1) of section 43 of the Act;
(c)
"Chairperson" means the Chairperson of the Board;
(d)
"Council" means the Council of the Institute composed under section 12 of the Act;
(e)
"Institute" means the Institute of Actuaries of India constituted under section 3 of the Act;
(f)
"Member" means Member of the Board.
(2)
Words and expressions used herein and not defined in these rules but defined in the Act shall have the same meaning
respectively assigned to them in the Act.
